<Page xmlns:uen="using:Uno.Extensions.Navigation.UI"
	  xmlns:uer="using:Uno.Extensions.Reactive.UI"
	  xmlns:utu="using:Uno.Toolkit.UI"
	  xmlns:utum="using:Uno.Toolkit.UI.Material"
	  xmlns:muxc="using:Microsoft.UI.Xaml.Controls"
	  xmlns:ut="using:Uno.Themes"
	  xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml"
	  xmlns:mc="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/markup-compatibility/2006"
	  xmlns:d="http://schemas.microsoft.com/expression/blend/2008"
	  xmlns:local="using:Chefs.Views"
	  xmlns:igm="using:Infragistics.Controls.Maps"
	  xmlns:igc="using:Infragistics.Controls.Charts"
	  x:Class="Chefs.Views.MapPage"
	  xmlns:not_mobile="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml/presentation"
	  mc:Ignorable="d"
	  Background="{ThemeResource BackgroundBrush}"
	  utu:StatusBar.Foreground="Dark"
	  utu:StatusBar.Background="{ThemeResource SurfaceInverseBrush}"
	  xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml/presentation">
	<utu:AutoLayout>
		<utu:NavigationBar Content="Near me" />
		<Grid utu:AutoLayout.PrimaryAlignment="Stretch">
			<igm:XamGeographicMap x:Name="GeoMap"
								  Zoomable="True">
				<igm:XamGeographicMap.Series>
					<!-- Contributor bubbles sized by recipe count -->
					<igm:GeographicProportionalSymbolSeries x:Name="ContributorSeries"
															LatitudeMemberPath="Lat"
															LongitudeMemberPath="Lng"
															RadiusMemberPath="Recipes"
															MarkerType="Circle"
															MarkerBrush="{ThemeResource PrimaryBrush}"
															MarkerOutline="{ThemeResource OnPrimaryBrush}"
															MarkerThickness="2">
						<igm:GeographicProportionalSymbolSeries.RadiusScale>
							<igc:SizeScale MinimumValue="24"
										   MaximumValue="48" />
						</igm:GeographicProportionalSymbolSeries.RadiusScale>
					</igm:GeographicProportionalSymbolSeries>
					<igm:GeographicProportionalSymbolSeries x:Name="MyLocationSeries"
															LatitudeMemberPath="Lat"
															LongitudeMemberPath="Lng"
															RadiusMemberPath="Recipes"
															MarkerType="Circle"
															MarkerBrush="{ThemeResource SurfaceInverseBrush}"
															MarkerOutline="{ThemeResource OnPrimaryBrush}"
															MarkerThickness="3">
						<igm:GeographicProportionalSymbolSeries.RadiusScale>
							<igc:SizeScale MinimumValue="18"
										   MaximumValue="18" />
						</igm:GeographicProportionalSymbolSeries.RadiusScale>
					</igm:GeographicProportionalSymbolSeries>
				</igm:XamGeographicMap.Series>
			</igm:XamGeographicMap>

			<!-- Callout shown when a pin is tapped -->
			<Canvas IsHitTestVisible="False">
				<Border x:Name="Callout"
						Visibility="Collapsed"
						MaxWidth="160"
						Padding="12,8"
						CornerRadius="8"
						Background="{ThemeResource SurfaceBrush}"
						BorderBrush="{ThemeResource OutlineVariantBrush}"
						BorderThickness="1">
					<StackPanel>
						<TextBlock x:Name="CalloutTitle"
								   Style="{StaticResource TitleSmall}"
								   Foreground="{ThemeResource OnSurfaceBrush}" />
						<TextBlock x:Name="CalloutSubtitle"
								   Style="{StaticResource BodySmall}"
								   Foreground="{ThemeResource OnSurfaceVariantBrush}" />
					</StackPanel>
				</Border>
			</Canvas>

			<StackPanel Margin="36"
						Spacing="8"
						HorizontalAlignment="Left"
						VerticalAlignment="Top">
				<Button Content="+"
						Width="40"
						Height="40"
						Padding="0"
						Click="OnZoomInClick" />
				<Button Content="−"
						Width="40"
						Height="40"
						Padding="0"
						Click="OnZoomOutClick" />
			</StackPanel>
		</Grid>
	</utu:AutoLayout>
</Page>
